                                                "sense_id": "097506d7-9d04-39fb-9649-234814cf3b32",
                                                "text": "To have her captiv'd ſpirit freed from fleſh, / And on her Innocence, a garment freſh / And vvhite, as that, put on: and in her hand / VVith boughs of Palme, a crovvned Victrice ſtand."
